<!doctype html>
<html lang="ms">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="description" content="Terokai kejiranan bersama Chill Boy, dari kawasan kediaman ke bukit kecil. Selesaikan tiga mesin fungsi untuk membuka laluan.">
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'">
  <title>Lorong Atas Bumbung — Add Math</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="data:,">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
  <script defer src="vendor/phaser-3.90.0.min.js"></script>
  <script type="module" src="src/game.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="shell">
    <header class="masthead">
      <a class="back-link" href="../">← <span>Add Math</span></a>
      <div class="heading"><h1>Lorong Atas Bumbung</h1><p>Level 1 <span> / </span> Tingkatan 4 · Fungsi</p></div>
      <div class="masthead-controls"><button type="button" id="fullscreen">Skrin penuh</button><button type="button" id="pause" disabled>Jeda <kbd>Esc</kbd></button></div>
    </header>
    <div class="game-stage">
      <section class="game-frame" aria-label="Permainan platform Lorong Atas Bumbung">
        <div id="game" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="Kawasan permainan. A dan D untuk bergerak, Space untuk lompat, W dan S untuk tangga, E untuk mesin."></div>
        <div class="hud" aria-hidden="true"><span id="objective">Terokai lorong. Cari jalan ke atas.</span><span id="checkpoint-state">Mula di rumah</span></div>
        <div id="zone-toast" class="zone-toast" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div id="coin-count" hidden></div>
        <div id="loading" class="loading" role="status">Memuatkan kejiranan… <span id="load-progress">0%</span></div>
        <section id="welcome" class="welcome" hidden aria-labelledby="welcome-title">
          <h2 id="welcome-title">Satu lorong.<br>Banyak laluan.</h2>
          <p>Bawa Chill Boy dari rumah ke bukit kecil. Selesaikan tiga mesin fungsi untuk membuka laluan.</p>
          <dl class="control-list"><div><dt><kbd>A</kbd> <kbd>D</kbd></dt><dd>Bergerak</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>Space</kbd></dt><dd>Lompat</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>W</kbd> <kbd>S</kbd></dt><dd>Naik / turun tangga</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>E</kbd></dt><dd>Gunakan mesin</dd></div></dl>
          <button type="button" id="start" class="primary">Mula meneroka <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <p class="small">Tiada had masa. Tersilap? Cuba lagi.</p>
        </section>
        <div id="touch-controls" class="touch-controls" aria-label="Kawalan sentuh" hidden>
          <div class="touch-group"><button type="button" data-hold="left" aria-label="Bergerak kiri">←</button><button type="button" data-hold="right" aria-label="Bergerak kanan">→</button></div>
          <div class="touch-group"><button type="button" data-hold="up" aria-label="Naik tangga">↑</button><button type="button" data-hold="down" aria-label="Turun tangga">↓</button><button type="button" data-action="interact" class="interact">Guna</button><button type="button" data-action="jump" class="jump">Lompat</button></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
    <footer class="game-footer">
      <ol class="route" aria-label="Kemajuan level" hidden><li data-step="0" aria-current="step">Rumah</li><li data-step="1">Pekan</li><li data-step="2">Café</li><li data-step="3">Bengkel</li><li data-step="4">Bumbung</li><li data-step="5">Bukit</li><li data-step="6">Jambatan</li></ol>
      <p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Ikut jalan ke kanan. Tiga mesin fungsi menanti sepanjang laluan.</p>
    </footer>
    <p class="portrait-help">Kawalan sentuh tersedia. Putar telefon untuk pandangan bumbung yang lebih luas.</p>
  </main>
  <dialog id="puzzle" aria-labelledby="puzzle-title">
    <button type="button" class="close" id="close-puzzle" aria-label="Tutup mesin">×</button>
    <h2 id="puzzle-title">Hidupkan mesin</h2>
    <p id="puzzle-given">Diberi x = 3.</p>
    <div class="equation" id="equation">f(x) = 2x + 1</div>
    <p id="puzzle-prompt">Cari f(3).</p>
    <form id="answer-form" novalidate>
      <label for="answer" id="answer-label">Jawapan f(3)</label>
      <div class="answer-row"><input id="answer" name="answer" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" maxlength="12" aria-describedby="answer-feedback" placeholder="Masukkan nombor"><button type="submit" class="primary">Uji input</button></div>
      <p id="answer-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite">Masukkan satu nombor.</p>
    </form>
    <div class="hint-area">
      <ul id="hint-list" class="hint-list"></ul>
      <button type="button" id="hint-btn" class="secondary">Minta hint</button>
    </div>
    <p class="small">Tingkatan 4 · Fungsi — setiap input dipadankan dengan satu output.</p>
  </dialog>
  <dialog id="paused" aria-labelledby="pause-title"><h2 id="pause-title">Rehat sekejap.</h2><p>Lorong ini menunggu. Sambung apabila sedia.</p><p class="keyboard-help">Gerak <kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>→</kbd> / <kbd>A</kbd> <kbd>D</kbd> <span>·</span> Lompat <kbd>Space</kbd> <span>·</span> Tangga <kbd>↑</kbd> <kbd>↓</kbd> <span>·</span> Mesin <kbd>E</kbd> <span>·</span> Checkpoint <kbd>R</kbd></p><div class="dialog-actions"><button type="button" id="resume" class="primary">Sambung</button><button type="button" id="restart">Mula semula</button><a href="../">Kembali ke nota</a></div></dialog>
  <dialog id="complete" aria-labelledby="complete-title"><h2 id="complete-title">Level 1 Selesai!</h2><p>Tiga mesin fungsi diselesaikan. Destinasi di bukit kecil berjaya dicapai.</p><p class="small">Konsep yang dipelajari: mencari output daripada input (f(3) = 7), dan mencari input daripada output yang diketahui (3x − 2 = 10, 4x − 3 = 17).</p><p id="completion-time" class="small"></p><p id="completion-coins" class="small"></p><p id="completion-puzzles" class="small"></p><div class="dialog-actions"><button type="button" id="replay" class="primary">Main semula</button><a href="../">Kembali ke peta Add Math</a></div></dialog>
  <noscript><p>Aktifkan JavaScript untuk bermain. <a href="../">Kembali ke Add Math.</a></p></noscript>
</body>
</html>
